{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37223","headline":"下第後上永崇高侍郎 · 高蟾","name":"下第後上永崇高侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上碧桃和露种，日边红杏倚云栽。\n芙蓉生在秋江上，不向东风怨未开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「下第后上永崇高侍郎」条，撰者周啸天、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}